{"font_size": 0.4, "font_color": "#FFFFFF", "background_alpha": 0.5, "background_color": "#9C27B0", "Stroke": "none", "type": "AIsubtitle", "lang": "zh", "version": "v1.7.0.4", "body": [{"from": 1.92, "to": 3.2, "sid": 1, "location": 2, "content": "好的欢迎回来", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 3.2, "to": 4.58, "sid": 2, "location": 2, "content": "这里是娃娃网校", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 4.58, "to": 6.61, "sid": 3, "location": 2, "content": "我是天堂啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 6.61, "to": 12.9, "sid": 4, "location": 2, "content": "那么本期视频呢我们主要讨论的话题是", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 13.7, "to": 14.34, "sid": 5, "location": 2, "content": "聚焦", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 15.34, "to": 19.35, "sid": 6, "location": 2, "content": "那我们都知道那眼睛你看近的物体对吧", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 19.35, "to": 21.93, "sid": 7, "location": 2, "content": "那你后面背后的东西就会虚焦", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 21.93, "to": 23.11, "sid": 8, "location": 2, "content": "就看不清啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 23.11, "to": 25.67, "sid": 9, "location": 2, "content": "当然你在游戏内不是这样的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 25.67, "to": 29.35, "sid": 10, "location": 2, "content": "因为毕竟游戏是一个屏幕显示出来的东西", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 29.35, "to": 33.149, "sid": 11, "location": 2, "content": "你并不会因为看近处的东西而啊失焦", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 33.149, "to": 34.169, "sid": 12, "location": 2, "content": "远处的东西", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 34.169, "to": 39.45, "sid": 13, "location": 2, "content": "那大家现在呢也不妨拿出呃手指啧对吧", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 39.45, "to": 42.37, "sid": 14, "location": 2, "content": "拿出手指拿一根啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 42.37, "to": 47.07, "sid": 15, "location": 2, "content": "随便哪一根都可以把它比在你的额正前方", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 47.07, "to": 49.33, "sid": 16, "location": 2, "content": "那么你的眼睛看着你的食指", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 49.33, "to": 52.77, "sid": 17, "location": 2, "content": "你就会发现它背后的东西变虚了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 52.77, "to": 56.38, "sid": 18, "location": 2, "content": "那你这个时候呢你再看手指后面的东西", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 56.38, "to": 59.74, "sid": 19, "location": 2, "content": "那你的眼睛此时就会发现啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 59.74, "to": 62.5, "sid": 20, "location": 2, "content": "你的手指会出现两根儿对吧", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 62.5, "to": 64.8, "sid": 21, "location": 2, "content": "同时也是虚的对吧", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 64.8, "to": 66.86, "sid": 22, "location": 2, "content": "那同学们都发现了这件事情过后", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 66.86, "to": 68.02, "sid": 23, "location": 2, "content": "那我们讲这是什么", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 68.02, "to": 72.38, "sid": 24, "location": 2, "content": "这是现实生活中的一个呃失焦而导致的变虚化", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 72.38, "to": 77.15, "sid": 25, "location": 2, "content": "但实际上呢在游戏中并不会出现这种情况啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 77.15, "to": 82.66, "sid": 26, "location": 2, "content": "比如说我看这个bot后面的墙也依然清晰对吧", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 82.82, "to": 87.26, "sid": 27, "location": 2, "content": "我看那个bot后面的其他人也依然清晰对吧", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 87.26, "to": 88.78, "sid": 28, "location": 2, "content": "只是可能没有啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 88.78, "to": 92.31, "sid": 29, "location": 2, "content": "那么的呃好捕捉", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 92.83, "to": 95.15, "sid": 30, "location": 2, "content": "那么这就引入我们本期的话题", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 95.15, "to": 96.67, "sid": 31, "location": 2, "content": "你在瞄准的时候", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 96.67, "to": 99.09, "sid": 32, "location": 2, "content": "你到底该聚焦什么", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 99.09, "to": 101.545, "sid": 33, "location": 2, "content": "那很多啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 102.36, "to": 104.6, "sid": 34, "location": 2, "content": "包括很多博主也说过", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 104.6, "to": 105.86, "sid": 35, "location": 2, "content": "那很多同学反映", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 105.86, "to": 107.28, "sid": 36, "location": 2, "content": "他们一直都看准星", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 107.28, "to": 109.36, "sid": 37, "location": 2, "content": "看准星去瞄准", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 110.47, "to": 111.01, "sid": 38, "location": 2, "content": "对吧", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 111.01, "to": 111.71, "sid": 39, "location": 2, "content": "像我这样子", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 111.71, "to": 113.67, "sid": 40, "location": 2, "content": "我去看准星瞄准", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 119.26, "to": 119.78, "sid": 41, "location": 2, "content": "对吧", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 119.78, "to": 121.66, "sid": 42, "location": 2, "content": "只是看准星瞄准", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 125.08, "to": 125.66, "sid": 43, "location": 2, "content": "对吧", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 125.66, "to": 128.64, "sid": 44, "location": 2, "content": "我注意力一直都放在准心上的话", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 130.14, "to": 131.66, "sid": 45, "location": 2, "content": "那这是看准新的区域", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 131.66, "to": 133.18, "sid": 46, "location": 2, "content": "一个瞄准", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 136.04, "to": 139.4, "sid": 47, "location": 2, "content": "那我如果说我去聚焦目标呢", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 149.76, "to": 152.84, "sid": 48, "location": 2, "content": "那大家也可以去靶场里面去尝试一下", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 153.88, "to": 157.56, "sid": 49, "location": 2, "content": "如果说把你的注意力一直盯着你的准星看", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 157.56, "to": 160.84, "sid": 50, "location": 2, "content": "去尝试一个呃瞄准", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 160.84, "to": 162.12, "sid": 51, "location": 2, "content": "你会发现一件事情", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 162.12, "to": 164.38, "sid": 52, "location": 2, "content": "就是你看不清", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 164.38, "to": 166.28, "sid": 53, "location": 2, "content": "你有点看不清目标了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 166.28, "to": 171.2, "sid": 54, "location": 2, "content": "或者说有的时候如果范围比较大的一个拉枪", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 171.2, "to": 174.52, "sid": 55, "location": 2, "content": "你可能会比较难以去捕捉目标", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 179.42, "to": 181.42, "sid": 56, "location": 2, "content": "啊那么尝试完了过后呢", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 181.42, "to": 185.17, "sid": 57, "location": 2, "content": "那我这里就直接告诉大家一个啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 185.17, "to": 188.69, "sid": 58, "location": 2, "content": "我自己的一个最优解法是什么呢", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 188.69, "to": 190.68, "sid": 59, "location": 2, "content": "去聚焦目标", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 190.68, "to": 192.26, "sid": 60, "location": 2, "content": "那我们为什么这么讲呢", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 192.26, "to": 195.12, "sid": 61, "location": 2, "content": "那大家也可以引入一个啊生活中的一个案例", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 195.12, "to": 198.13, "sid": 62, "location": 2, "content": "那大家包括额很多时候你去拿东西", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 198.13, "to": 198.65, "sid": 63, "location": 2, "content": "对不对", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 198.65, "to": 199.99, "sid": 64, "location": 2, "content": "你眼睛是看到了东", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 199.99, "to": 202.75, "sid": 65, "location": 2, "content": "你要拿的东西手自然就伸过去了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 202.75, "to": 203.69, "sid": 66, "location": 2, "content": "你就拿起了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 203.69, "to": 207.0, "sid": 67, "location": 2, "content": "那大家不妨啊随便在身边找一个小物件", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 207.0, "to": 207.64, "sid": 68, "location": 2, "content": "对不对", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 207.64, "to": 210.0, "sid": 69, "location": 2, "content": "你的眼睛是先看到那个物件", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 210.0, "to": 211.84, "sid": 70, "location": 2, "content": "然后呢手就伸过去", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 211.84, "to": 215.73, "sid": 71, "location": 2, "content": "然后当手和物件啊接触", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 215.73, "to": 217.65, "sid": 72, "location": 2, "content": "那这也就称之为确认好", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 217.65, "to": 219.56, "sid": 73, "location": 2, "content": "你再把他抓起来对吧", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 219.56, "to": 222.22, "sid": 74, "location": 2, "content": "这就是你完成一个捡起动作的一个过程", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 222.22, "to": 224.68, "sid": 75, "location": 2, "content": "那么在我们的瞄准里面呢", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 224.88, "to": 228.56, "sid": 76, "location": 2, "content": "我想啊让大家这样子尝试去理解", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 229.68, "to": 231.57, "sid": 77, "location": 2, "content": "我看到了一个目标", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 231.57, "to": 233.92, "sid": 78, "location": 2, "content": "我的手自然的放过去", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 233.92, "to": 236.04, "sid": 79, "location": 2, "content": "当准星与目标重合", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 236.04, "to": 237.82, "sid": 80, "location": 2, "content": "所以我就开火", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 237.82, "to": 240.9, "sid": 81, "location": 2, "content": "那么首先是看清楚我的目标", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 240.9, "to": 243.9, "sid": 82, "location": 2, "content": "那这个时候可能啊对吧", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 243.9, "to": 245.62, "sid": 83, "location": 2, "content": "我这样一个拉枪", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 245.849, "to": 247.769, "sid": 84, "location": 2, "content": "我是一直看着这个目标拉", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 247.769, "to": 251.009, "sid": 85, "location": 2, "content": "然后当我的准心接触到他的时候", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 251.009, "to": 252.649, "sid": 86, "location": 2, "content": "我就把他杀击杀掉", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 252.649, "to": 255.71, "sid": 87, "location": 2, "content": "那大家也可以去感受这种感觉对吧", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 255.71, "to": 257.37, "sid": 88, "location": 2, "content": "我把他看着拉", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 257.37, "to": 260.11, "sid": 89, "location": 2, "content": "然后停住对吧", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 262.56, "to": 263.48, "sid": 90, "location": 2, "content": "去尝试一下", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 263.48, "to": 265.0, "sid": 91, "location": 2, "content": "比如说我选择这个目标", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 265.0, "to": 266.5, "sid": 92, "location": 2, "content": "我一直盯着他", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 266.5, "to": 268.82, "sid": 93, "location": 2, "content": "然后我把准星放过来", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 268.82, "to": 269.72, "sid": 94, "location": 2, "content": "我一直盯着他", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 269.72, "to": 272.13, "sid": 95, "location": 2, "content": "然后我把准心放过来对吧", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 272.13, "to": 273.25, "sid": 96, "location": 2, "content": "我一直盯着这个人", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 273.25, "to": 275.73, "sid": 97, "location": 2, "content": "然后我就把准心放过来对吧", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 275.73, "to": 279.3, "sid": 98, "location": 2, "content": "我盯着这个人点这个人", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 280.46, "to": 281.92, "sid": 99, "location": 2, "content": "那大家可以去尝试一下", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 281.92, "to": 284.66, "sid": 100, "location": 2, "content": "也眼睛一直去盯着这样一个人", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 293.56, "to": 294.04, "sid": 101, "location": 2, "content": "对吧", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 294.04, "to": 297.96, "sid": 102, "location": 2, "content": "你会去感受一种好像是好3.1线一般", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 297.96, "to": 301.4, "sid": 103, "location": 2, "content": "而你的手你的准心就像你的手指一样", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 301.4, "to": 303.27, "sid": 104, "location": 2, "content": "你指向了这个人一样", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 303.27, "to": 304.75, "sid": 105, "location": 2, "content": "你眼睛看到了目标", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 304.75, "to": 307.43, "sid": 106, "location": 2, "content": "然后你手指很自然的去指向这个目标", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 307.43, "to": 311.6, "sid": 107, "location": 2, "content": "然后你会发现其实瞄准会简单很多", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 311.6, "to": 312.68, "sid": 108, "location": 2, "content": "这也是为什么", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 312.68, "to": 316.22, "sid": 109, "location": 2, "content": "很多时候大家会有发挥不稳定的时候", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 316.22, "to": 317.99, "sid": 110, "location": 2, "content": "其实你眼睛失焦了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 317.99, "to": 319.79, "sid": 111, "location": 2, "content": "你不知道去看到了准星", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 319.79, "to": 321.27, "sid": 112, "location": 2, "content": "还是去看到了别的东西", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 321.27, "to": 324.0, "sid": 113, "location": 2, "content": "还是你过度的去关注地图本身", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 324.0, "to": 326.8, "sid": 114, "location": 2, "content": "比如类似于我注注意力放在墙上", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 326.8, "to": 328.48, "sid": 115, "location": 2, "content": "或者我聚焦在这个墙上", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 328.48, "to": 331.54, "sid": 116, "location": 2, "content": "我是很难去看清楚远距离的bot的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 331.54, "to": 332.24, "sid": 117, "location": 2, "content": "对不对", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 332.24, "to": 333.96, "sid": 118, "location": 2, "content": "如果说我看到了那个人", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 333.96, "to": 335.98, "sid": 119, "location": 2, "content": "然后我就这样子去做一个定位", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 335.98, "to": 338.8, "sid": 120, "location": 2, "content": "我手很自然的去指过去了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 339.17, "to": 340.45, "sid": 121, "location": 2, "content": "很赞的去指", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 340.45, "to": 342.91, "sid": 122, "location": 2, "content": "还包括可能我的预瞄摆低了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 342.91, "to": 345.23, "sid": 123, "location": 2, "content": "然后看到那个人我很赞的就往上抬", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 345.23, "to": 348.425, "sid": 124, "location": 2, "content": "很赞的就往上抬对吧", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 348.64, "to": 351.76, "sid": 125, "location": 2, "content": "这种的就是我们讲的什么聚焦", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 351.76, "to": 356.04, "sid": 126, "location": 2, "content": "也也包括着就啊有的有的人也喜欢叫他focus", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 356.04, "to": 358.08, "sid": 127, "location": 2, "content": "那很多同同学可能会理解到啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 358.08, "to": 360.2, "sid": 128, "location": 2, "content": "focus那不是专注的意思吗", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 360.2, "to": 363.0, "sid": 129, "location": 2, "content": "实际上focus也有聚焦的意思", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 363.36, "to": 364.22, "sid": 130, "location": 2, "content": "懂吧", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 364.22, "to": 366.02, "sid": 131, "location": 2, "content": "实际上有聚焦的意思", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 366.02, "to": 367.84, "sid": 132, "location": 2, "content": "那也可以理解为啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 367.84, "to": 371.69, "sid": 133, "location": 2, "content": "但也可以理解为将注意力分配在捕捉目标上", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 371.69, "to": 376.02, "sid": 134, "location": 2, "content": "而不是始终看着你的准心去尝试", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 376.02, "to": 379.17, "sid": 135, "location": 2, "content": "去阅读你的呃速速度", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 379.17, "to": 380.55, "sid": 136, "location": 2, "content": "你的准星速度", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 380.55, "to": 382.27, "sid": 137, "location": 2, "content": "当你抓到这个目标的时候", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 382.27, "to": 384.27, "sid": 138, "location": 2, "content": "你把准心往他身头上移", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 384.27, "to": 385.97, "sid": 139, "location": 2, "content": "抓到一个目标的时候", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 385.97, "to": 386.97, "sid": 140, "location": 2, "content": "往上移", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 386.97, "to": 388.13, "sid": 141, "location": 2, "content": "抓到一个目标了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 388.13, "to": 389.17, "sid": 142, "location": 2, "content": "一直盯着他", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 390.33, "to": 392.45, "sid": 143, "location": 2, "content": "一直去盯着你那个目标", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 392.79, "to": 394.07, "sid": 144, "location": 2, "content": "去做一个定位", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 394.07, "to": 395.67, "sid": 145, "location": 2, "content": "去盯着他", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 397.56, "to": 398.12, "sid": 146, "location": 2, "content": "对吧", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 398.12, "to": 405.77, "sid": 147, "location": 2, "content": "盯着他盯着这个盯着他盯着这个对吧", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 405.77, "to": 407.95, "sid": 148, "location": 2, "content": "去靶场里面找一个目标", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 407.95, "to": 409.03, "sid": 149, "location": 2, "content": "然后一直把他盯着", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 409.03, "to": 411.89, "sid": 150, "location": 2, "content": "你会发现哎其实定位会比较简单", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 411.89, "to": 413.57, "sid": 151, "location": 2, "content": "并不难", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 415.14, "to": 417.7, "sid": 152, "location": 2, "content": "那这就引入到我们刚刚说的啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 417.7, "to": 420.19, "sid": 153, "location": 2, "content": "你聚焦该聚焦到哪", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 420.51, "to": 423.48, "sid": 154, "location": 2, "content": "那么大家呢下去过后呃", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 423.48, "to": 425.9, "sid": 155, "location": 2, "content": "在靶场去尝试一下这种感觉", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 425.9, "to": 427.78, "sid": 156, "location": 2, "content": "一定要去抓到那种感觉", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 427.78, "to": 430.78, "sid": 157, "location": 2, "content": "那么这边实战呢我也建议大家去玩啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 430.78, "to": 432.81, "sid": 158, "location": 2, "content": "团队乱斗和死斗啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 432.81, "to": 434.79, "sid": 159, "location": 2, "content": "这样子去练习会比较好一点", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 434.79, "to": 435.35, "sid": 160, "location": 2, "content": "为什么呢", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 435.35, "to": 437.17, "sid": 161, "location": 2, "content": "因为包括像死斗", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 437.17, "to": 438.27, "sid": 162, "location": 2, "content": "团队乱斗也好", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 438.27, "to": 440.71, "sid": 163, "location": 2, "content": "那死斗可能要稍微少一点", "music": 0.0}, {"from":